{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a thrilling world of treacherous dungeons, and endless combat! Knight of the Dungeon is a heart-pounding fusion of Rogue-Like and Bullet-Hell, with procedurally generated rooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648620/extras/screenshot_3.png?t=1750614330\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Dungeons</strong> - Explore ever-changing levels filled with secrets. No two playthroughs will be the same!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Combat</strong> - Fight hordes of monsters and mighty bosses while dodging spaces. Reflexes and strategy are your best allies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progress and loot </strong>- in each location you will find new weapons and magical artifacts that will change your style of play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Small inventory size\u00a0</strong>- you only have three slots. Use them wisely!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Magic system </strong>- thanks to a well-thought-out magic system, you will be able to create your own spells.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A story shrouded in mystery </strong>- interact with mysterious NPCs and uncover the history of this dangerous world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for challenges and adventures, your journey begins right now!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648620?t=1750614330","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648620?t=1750614330","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648620/f62c373075